OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight will
OL,6,Fbe murky for most with low cloud and
OL,7,Fpatchy rain, but turning drier by
OL,8,Fmorning. Towards the coast, drier with
OL,9,Fclear spells. Winds will remain light
OL,10,Fthroughout with temperatures near the
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FMurky and wet conditions clear
OL,14,Fon Friday, with sunny spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping later. Winds will be light
OL,16,Fand daytime temperatures near normal,
OL,17,Fbut dropping overnight with widespread
OL,18,Ffrost and patchy fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
